OL,3,GNEWSAPreparation work on #200m motorway
OL,4,Alink road
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreparation work is underway on a #200m
OL,7,Fproject to directly link the eastbound
OL,8,FM54 with the M6.
OL,10,FVegetation is being cleared and two
OL,11,Flarge construction compounds are being
OL,12,Fbuilt, along with temporary roads.
OL,14,FNational Highways has announced a
OL,15,Fnumber of diversions and closures,
OL,16,Fwhich are due to start next month.
OL,18,FThe government gave final approval for
OL,19,Fthe link road last year and the work is
OL,20,Fexpected to take five years to
OL,21,Fcomplete.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
